# Canonical host: 301 the apex (non-www) domain to www.
# NOTE: the apex -> www redirect is enforced by a ZONE-LEVEL Redirect Rule
# (ref: apex_to_www_301, Rules > Redirect Rules in the Cloudflare dashboard,
# zone findfrolf.com) — Pages' _redirects does not fire for host-to-host
# redirects. The rule below is kept as documentation/fallback only.
https://findfrolf.com/* https://www.findfrolf.com/:splat 301

# Dedupe: Arlington "Veterans Park" (TX-1145) 301s to the canonical
# listing (TX-1352). See AdSense remediation spec §3.2 / §4.5.
/tx/dallas-fort-worth/veterans/ /tx/dallas-fort-worth/veterans-park-J93i/ 301

# /map/ and /events/ never shipped as pages. The course map lives at
# /finder/ and local events live on city pages. 301 so old links and
# Search Console entries resolve instead of 404ing.
/map /finder/ 301
/map/ /finder/ 301
/events /cities/ 301
/events/ /cities/ 301
